                                        "entry_id": "85c0adff-862f-323d-ae13-e9e9987f60df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The Lom, a nomadic people related to the Rom and Dom, with origins in India, who reside in the South Caucasus; Caucasian Gypsies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "plural",
